{"unit_id":"zhijun-dai__Catppuccin-dsh-theme#card-zh","repo":"zhijun-dai/Catppuccin-dsh-theme","commit":"9d18edc84a13fb6009391677046ddedec267ecdc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-catppuccin 为 DSH Web、Desktop 与 TUI 提供四款 Catppuccin 柔和配色主题。Web 端把 Latte、Frappé、Macchiato、Mocha 注册到内置主题运行时，并在 Settings → General 提供切换项；选择会保存在浏览器及主机状态文件中。插件还会把四款配色同步到 dsh-TUI，并在设置页查询版本更新。适合想统一桌面与终端外观、并可随时恢复默认主题的 DSH 用户。无需 API Key 或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.tpl.js:1211-1235","lib/index.js:296-332","lib/tui-themes.js:45-78"]}
